        "type": "chapter_title",
        "text_ref": "从哪里开始",
        "align": "left",
        "size": "medium"
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text_ref": "先运行 scripts/Install-EmeraldVeil.ps1 -Action Install，再运行 scripts/Set-NativeBubbles.ps1 -Action Enable；日常等六分钟空闲，也可以按 Ctrl+Win+E、双击托盘图标或点托盘“立即启动”马上显示，或用托盘预览看最多 15 秒。",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "40%"
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "需要准备什么",
        "row": "start",
        "icon_position": "header_left",
        "header_icon": "_library/hires-icons/icon-clean-0432a3e02a060c22b01c.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "从开始到拿到结果",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "60%",
        "heading_icon": "_library/icons/scene-r3-exact-three-stairs.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. **启用并待机**　程序观察可靠输入，并按显示器的硬件身份挑一块可用的实体屏；没有合格的屏或输入状态不可信时保持待命。",
        "row": "start",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
      }
    ]
